cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using
  the metadata below.

title: "Hiberno-English Parser"
abstract: >
  A modular Python codebase for parsing and evaluating structured field
  extraction from A Dictionary of Hiberno-English (Dolan, 2006).
  Provides a rule-based parser and a GenAI (LLM-assisted) extraction
  pipeline, along with a side-by-side evaluation framework.

